# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Everything here is OPTIONAL: the app's data
# sources (Darwin VAAC over BOM's public FTP, Open-Meteo wind, Esri basemap
# tiles) are all keyless, and the app runs fully without this file.

# Published NOTAMs for an aerodrome, shown under "Airports under ash".
# A RapidAPI key for the SkyLink NOTAM API (FAA SWIM FNS):
#   https://rapidapi.com/skylink-api-skylink-api-default/api/skylink-api
# Free tier is 1,000 requests/month, so /api/notams caches per ICAO for 10 min.
# Read server-side only; it is never sent to the browser.
# Unset, the lookup reports itself unconfigured and nothing else changes.
SKYLINK_API_KEY=
